      "type": "text",
      "text": "# **Pháp Cú**\n# appamādena maghavā, devānaṃ seṭṭhataṃ gato. \n# appamādaṃ pasaṃsanti, pamādo garahito sadā. \n \n# yathāpi ruciraṃ pupphaṃ, vaṇṇavantaṃ agandhakaṃ. \n# evaṃ subhāsitā vācā, aphalā hoti akubbato. ",
